    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute (BMI), through the Africa FINGERS project team, brought together community members, researchers, and health officials for validation workshops in Nairobi on October 27 and in Kilifi on October 29, 2025. The sessions were held to review community designed ideas for reducing dementia risk and supporting healthy aging.",
